es is from the film \'Some Like It Hot\'?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"\u201cWell, nobody\'s perfect\u201d is Osgood\'s closing line after Jerry reveals his disguise. Osgood is played by Joe E. Brown.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-54ca-7754-a2c8-901af39835d1","description":"\"Well, nobody\'s perfect.\"","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-54ca-7b67-ab83-401e6205d096","description":"\"Nobody puts Baby in a corner.\"","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-54ca-741b-84ba-def0897e0aa8","description":"\"My mother thanks you. My father thanks you. My sister thanks you. And I thank you.\"","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-54ca-7839-b727-1ba4db743abd","description":"\"I\'ll have what she\'s having.\"","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-54ca-75fc-9cdd-80d9951d281c","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-796c-8b3c-aa437bd658ff","question":"Which of these quotes is from the film \'Beyond the Forest\'?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"\u201cWhat a dump!\u201d became associated with Bette Davis, who played Rosa Moline; Elizabeth Taylor later echoed the line in Who\u2019s Afraid of Virginia Woolf?","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-54ca-7961-a8a8-6736d4e11552","description":"\"What a dump.\"","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-54ca-79d8-8bce-e3503b3a7dfc","description":"\"May the odds ever be in your favor.\"","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-54ca-7435-8cb3-b73ed201a867","description":"\"We\u2019re goin\u2019 streaking!\"","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-54ca-729f-ba69-5f03cc3076af","description":"\"Mother of mercy, is this the end of Rico?\"","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-54ca-73f4-9992-81f48333285d","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-796c-8b3c-aa437bd658ff","question":"Which actor played the role of Terry Malloy in On the Waterfront?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Marlon Brando won his first Academy Award for Best Actor for his performance in On the Waterfront.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-54ca-7f41-9b1e-8bff06e